      "text": "- Switching context two frequently\n- Mixing Functional and Non-Functional\n- Interviewer is not able to followup\n- The Design diagram arrows are very confusing\n- the data flow is not clear\n- Extending the design is difficult",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Switching context two frequently\n- Mixing Functional and Non-Functional\n- Interviewer is not able to followup\n- The Design diagram arrows are very confusing\n- the data flow is not clear\n- Extending the design is difficult",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
