      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Design a System that upgrades thousands of Machines on  the \nMoon.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Design a System that upgrades thousands of Machines on  the Moon.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1307,
      "versionNonce": 486888998,
      "index": "b8f",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "rnDgpeyuZnObYqYhQW1mW",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 80,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1939.5928975665452,
      "y": 21626.287528095476,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 617.439453125,
      "height": 540,
      "seed": 805071334,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1722794670625,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Requirements\n- Upgrades are getting triggered from the Earth\n    - There is interface/UI thats available on the Earth\n- User selects a build version (commit hash) and select the Moon as site\n  and triggers the upgrade\n- Able to see the progress of the Upgrade\n- Can see the Installed version on all the machines\n\nAssumptions\n-  This is a upgrade system only and the somehow the build tar bundle is\n   available on earth identified by commit hash\n\nNFRs\n- This system should be highly available because when there is something\n  wrong, the hot fixes would be deployed using this system,\n- The system should be scalable -> there could be multiple requests to upgrade\n- The system should have some capabilities of healing itself. \n\n\nEstimations\n- 100s of thousands of Machines\n- 10GB bundle for each hash\n- 10 upgrades/each day\n\n\n=> 100GB \n",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Requirements\n- Upgrades are getting triggered from the Earth\n    - There is interface/UI thats available on the Earth\n- User selects a build version (commit hash) and select the Moon as site\n  and triggers the upgrade\n- Able to see the progress of the Upgrade\n- Can see the Installed version on all the machines\n\nAssumptions\n-  This is a upgrade system only and the somehow the build tar bundle is\n   available on earth identified by commit hash\n\nNFRs\n- This system should be highly available because when there is something\n  wrong, the hot fixes would be deployed using this system,\n- The system should be scalable -> there could be multiple requests to upgrade\n- The system should have some capabilities of healing itself. \n\n\nEstimations\n- 100s of thousands of Machines\n- 10GB bundle for each hash\n- 10 upgrades/each day\n\n\n=> 100GB \n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
