      "text": "- downloads the bundle image from earth\n- store it in the filestore on the UpgradeManager\n- Fetch the Machine Information\n- Check the versions \n- Create and Push the MachineUpgradeJobs into the new Queue\n- The upgrade Planning Worker is smart and knows the fault tolerance of the and\n   creates the machine upgrade Jobs accordingly.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- downloads the bundle image from earth\n- store it in the filestore on the UpgradeManager\n- Fetch the Machine Information\n- Check the versions \n- Create and Push the MachineUpgradeJobs into the new Queue\n- The upgrade Planning Worker is smart and knows the fault tolerance of the and\n   creates the machine upgrade Jobs accordingly.",
